  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;CLAIRE ROGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Claire Rogers is a researcher known for her contributions to her field and her association with Curtin University and BGI Genomics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CURTIN UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Curtin University is a prominent institution of higher learning located in Perth, Western Australia, where Claire Rogers worked as a researcher."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Perth is the city where Curtin University is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BGI GENOMICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"BGI Genomics is a company headquartered in Shenzhen, known for its cutting-edge facilities in genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHENZHEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shenzhen is the city where BGI Genomics is headquartered."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOME OF THE PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Genome of the People is an ambitious initiative aimed at mapping the genetic diversity of the world's populations, led by Claire Rogers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WANG JIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wang Jian is the charismatic CEO of BGI Genomics, whose words inspired Claire Rogers to join the company."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. LI WEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Li Wei is a colleague of Claire Rogers at BGI Genomics, known for his enthusiasm in genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIBETAN PLATEAU SAMPLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Tibetan Plateau samples are part of the ongoing research at BGI Genomics, representing a unique genetic heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic research is the core activity of both Curtin University and BGI Genomics, focusing on understanding and utilizing genetic information."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovation is a key theme in both Claire Rogers' career and the work at BGI Genomics, driving advancements in genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC EXCELLENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic excellence is highlighted by Curtin University's reputation and Claire Rogers' contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUTTING-EDGE FACILITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cutting-edge facilities are a defining feature of BGI Genomics, enabling advanced genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research community refers to the collaborative environment at Curtin University where Claire Rogers was actively engaged."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARISMATIC LEADERSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charismatic leadership is exemplified by Wang Jian, inspiring Claire Rogers to join BGI Genomics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC DIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic diversity is the focus of the 'Genome of the People' initiative, aiming to map the genetic makeup of various populations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMANITY'S GENETIC CODE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Humanity's genetic code is the subject of the 'Genome of the People' initiative, representing a fundamental aspect of genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRIGHTER FUTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A brighter future is the goal of the 'Genome of the People' initiative, driven by the potential to improve human lives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STATE-OF-THE-ART FACILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"State-of-the-art facility describes the advanced research environment at BGI Genomics, where Claire Rogers works."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BREAK ROOM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Break room is a location within BGI Genomics where colleagues gather to socialize and enjoy refreshments."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEQUENCERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sequencers are the primary tools used in genetic research at BGI Genomics, enabling the analysis of genetic material."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC HERITAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic heritage refers to the unique genetic makeup of different populations, studied in the 'Genome of the People' initiative."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROJECT LAUNCH CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Project launch ceremony is a significant event marking the start of the 'Genome of the People' initiative, attended by Claire Rogers and Wang Jian."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARISMATIC CEO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charismatic CEO is a role held by Wang Jian at BGI Genomics, known for inspiring and leading the company."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUTTING-EDGE TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cutting-edge technology is a key aspect of BGI Genomics' operations, enabling advanced genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0192</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;CLAIRE ROGERS&quot;" target="&quot;CURTIN UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claire Rogers worked as a researcher at Curtin University, contributing to its reputation as a hub for innovative research and academic excellence."</data>
      <data key="d5">"employment, research contribution"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0192</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CLAIRE ROGERS&quot;" target="&quot;BGI GENOMICS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claire Rogers has been with BGI Genomics for nearly five years, leading the 'Genome of the People' initiative and feeling a deep sense of belonging there."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, research collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0192</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CLAIRE ROGERS&quot;" target="&quot;GENOME OF THE PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claire Rogers is the brainchild behind the 'Genome of the People' initiative, which aims to map the genetic diversity of the world's populations."</data>
      <data key="d5">"initiative leadership, research focus"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0192</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CURTIN UNIVERSITY&quot;" target="&quot;BGI GENOMICS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both institutions are involved in genetic research, with Curtin University providing Claire Rogers with her initial research experience and BGI Genomics offering advanced facilities for her current work."</data>
      <data key="d5">"institutional collaboration, research network"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0192</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BGI GENOMICS&quot;" target="&quot;GENOME OF THE PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BGI Genomics provided the necessary resources and expertise to bring the 'Genome of the People' initiative to life, highlighting the company's commitment to genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d5">"resource support, research partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0192</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BGI GENOMICS&quot;" target="&quot;WANG JIAN&quot;">
